{"path":"types/limits/FLT_ROUNDS","title":"FLT_ROUNDS","titleHtml":"FLT_ROUNDS","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/types/limits/FLT_ROUNDS","section":"types","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the current rounding direction of floating-point arithmetic operations.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/types/limits#Limits_of_floating-point_types\"><code>&lt;float.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"co2\">#define FLT_ROUNDS /* implementation defined */</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the current rounding direction of floating-point arithmetic operations.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td>  Value\n</td>\n<td>  Explanation\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <code>-1</code>\n</td>\n<td>  the default rounding direction is not known\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <code>0</code>\n</td>\n<td>  toward zero; same meaning as <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/FE_round\">FE_TOWARDZERO</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <code>1</code>\n</td>\n<td>  to nearest; same meaning as <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/FE_round\">FE_TONEAREST</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <code>2</code>\n</td>\n<td>  towards positive infinity; same meaning as <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/FE_round\">FE_UPWARD</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <code>3</code>\n</td>\n<td>  towards negative infinity; same meaning as <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/FE_round\">FE_DOWNWARD</a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  other values\n</td>\n<td>  implementation-defined behavior\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>The rounding mode can be changed with <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/feround\">fesetround</a></span> and <span class=\"t-lc\"><strong class=\"selflink\">FLT_ROUNDS</strong></span> reflects that change.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/feround\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fegetround</span><span>fesetround</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   gets or sets rounding  direction  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/FE_round\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>FE_DOWNWARD</span><span>FE_TONEAREST</span><span>FE_TOWARDZERO</span><span>FE_UPWARD</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   floating-point rounding direction <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(macro constant)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/climits/FLT_ROUNDS\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>FLT_ROUNDS</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"types","title":"Type support"},{"path":"types/limits","title":"Numeric limits"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"FLT_ROUNDS","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Returns the current rounding direction of floating-point arithmetic operations."},{"label":"Notes","note":"The rounding mode can be changed with fesetround and FLT_ROUNDS reflects that change.","children":[{"label":"FLT_ROUNDS"}]},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"fegetround, fesetround","note":"gets or sets rounding direction"},{"label":"FE_DOWNWARD, FE_TONEAREST, FE_TOWARDZERO, …","note":"floating-point rounding direction"}]}]},"standards":["C99"],"wordCount":96,"codeBlockCount":0}
